nt that he decided to start his own business even when his parents tried to stop him. But as cruel as the real world could be, he could only afford to open a small convenience store on his ｢own｣."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From Steam"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c84911"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c84912","characterName":"Cherry","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c84912"},"originalCharacterName":"Cherry","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A girl summoned here by the wind chimes. Her most distinctive feature is a pair of pointy fox ears and a fluffy tail. She’s usually quite careless, even a bit ignorant, but she’s reliable at critical moments."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From Steam"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c84912"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/c6/c64fc2fdc0aec4ed4ee869fb232651ecf2f8a700d376de814e97f01a4948eb1c.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/9e/9eb9a7a99a484c988be593445d144df491d7319f88ccba0f73726f40007ce438.webp","width":221,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"青柳 るう","creatorId":"vndb:s17658","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s17658","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s17658","name":"青柳 るう","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:82190","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c84913","characterName":"Purin","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c84913"},"originalCharacterName":"Purin","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"s